DATA PROVENANCE NOTICE

This repository contains NO real patient data and no protected health
information. All EHR and wearable data are synthetically generated by
`data/generate_ehr.py` and `data/generate_wearable.py` using numpy, and contain
no information about any real person. Any model trained on this data carries no
clinical validity and must not be used to inform patient care.
